)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">The magnitude is clinically meaningful=
 and validates zanidatamab=E2=80=99s biparatopic HER2 design in first line. H=
owever, the comparator lacked checkpoint inhibition, leaving unresolved how t=
he regimen performs against pembrolizumab-containing HER2 treatment. The labe=
l=E2=80=99s separation by HER2 intensity also reinforces that =E2=80=9CHER2-p=
ositive=E2=80=9D is not a biologically uniform commercial segment.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Separately, Akeso reported that <stron=
g>ivonescimab plus chemotherapy beat durvalumab plus chemotherapy on overall =
survival</strong>, while also meeting PFS and response endpoints, in first-li=
ne advanced biliary-tract cancer. Effect sizes remain undisclosed. (<a href=
=3D"https://akesobio.com/en/media/akeso-news/260826/?utm_source=3Dopenai" sty=
le=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">akesobio.com</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">This is strategically important becaus=
e it extends the PD-1/VEGF bispecific thesis beyond lung cancer and defeats a=
n active immunotherapy standard rather than chemotherapy alone. Confirmation =
requires detailed safety, geographic representation and survival data.</p>
<h4 style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#1=
2395b;margin:16px 0 6px;">Rusfertide converts phlebotomy reduction into an ap=
proved treatment paradigm</h4>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">FDA approved Takeda=E2=80=99s <strong>=
Mimrylo (rusfertide)</strong> on August 28 for erythrocytosis in adults with =
polycythemia vera. In the 293-patient VERIFY trial, 76.9% of patients met the=
 phlebotomy-control endpoint versus 32.9% on placebo. The weekly hepcidin mim=
etic limits iron availability for red-blood-cell production; common adverse r=
eactions included injection-site reactions and anemia. (<a href=3D"https://ww=
w.fda.gov/news-events/press-announcements/fda-approves-first-drug-its-kind-po=
lycythemia-vera-rare-blood-disorder" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:u=
nderline;">fda.gov</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">The commercial value comes from reduci=
ng a recurring care burden while addressing the biological machinery driving =
hematocrit elevation. The scientific caveat is equally important: maintaining=
 hematocrit and avoiding phlebotomy does not yet prove fewer thrombotic event=
s or longer survival. Real-world adoption will depend on whether convenience =
and symptom improvements justify chronic injections and monitoring.</p>
<h3 style=3D"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:17px;col=
or:#12395b;margin:22px 0 8px;">Transactions, Technology &amp; Operational Ris=
k</h3>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Lilly=E2=80=99s August 31 agreement to=
 acquire <strong>Merida Biosciences for up to $2.875 billion</strong> validat=
es selective degradation of pathogenic antibodies as an emerging immunology m=
odality. Lead asset MER511 is only in Phase 1 for Graves=E2=80=99 disease and=
 thyroid-eye disease, and the upfront payment was not disclosed, so the headl=
ine value should not be mistaken for a clinically de-risked valuation. Nevert=
heless, the transaction creates direct strategic competition for Biohaven=E2=
=80=99s extracellular protein-degrader platform. (<a href=3D"https://investor=
.lilly.com/node/54871/pdf" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;"=
>investor.lilly.com</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Biohaven simultaneously licensed world=
wide rights to its pivotal-stage Kv7 epilepsy platform, including opakalim, t=
o SK Biopharmaceuticals for $400 million in near-term payments and up to $795=
 million overall, plus royalties. The deal transfers substantial development =
and commercialization risk before the RISE3 readout while preserving capital =
for Biohaven=E2=80=99s broader pipeline. (<a href=3D"https://www.sec.gov/Arch=
ives/edgar/data/1935979/000193597926000072/bhvn-20260826.htm?utm_source=3Dope=
nai" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">sec.gov</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">In devices, FDA authorized Abbott=E2=
=80=99s <strong>Libre Duo</strong>, the first wearable continuously monitorin=
g both glucose and ketones. Clinical validation established analytical detect=
ion of elevated ketones before diabetic ketoacidosis, but commercial and paye=
r value will ultimately depend on demonstrating fewer emergency events. (<a h=
ref=3D"https://www.fda.gov/news-events/press-announcements/fda-authorizes-fir=
st-wearable-device-continuously-monitors-both-ketone-levels-and-blood-sugar" =
style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">fda.gov</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Among the supplied watchlist movers, o=
nly Boston Scientific had a consequential new development. A cybersecurity in=
cident caused global operational disruption, constrained order processing and=
 shipping, and interrupted pairing of some insertable cardiac monitors with r=
emote-monitoring applications. The episode illustrates that cybersecurity in =
connected medtech is now simultaneously a patient-workflow, supply-chain and =
revenue-continuity risk. (<a href=3D"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/=
885725/000088572526000056/bsx-20260826.htm?utm_source=3Dopenai" style=3D"colo=
r:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">sec.gov</a>)</p>
<h3 style=3D"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:17px;col=
or:#12395b;margin:22px 0 8px;">What I=E2=80=99m Watching Next</h3>
<ul style=3D"margin:0 0 12px;padding-left:22px;">
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;">Detailed INTerpath-001 melanoma and BN=
T122 colorectal data defining where personalized vaccines work.</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;">Daraxonrasib outcomes by RAS genotype =
and plans for first-line pancreatic cancer.</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;">Regulatory timing and positioning of V=
yvgart versus approved Lisraya in dermatomyositis.</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;">Full ivonescimab biliary-tract surviva=
l and safety results.</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;">Restoration of Boston Scientific=E2=80=
=99s ordering and remote-monitoring systems.</li>
</ul>
<h3 style=3D"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:17px;col=
or:#12395b;margin:22px 0 8px;">Bottom Line</h3>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">This week replaced several broad modal=
ity narratives with more discriminating ones. Personalized mRNA vaccination w=
orks in at least one pivotal combination setting but failed as monotherapy in=
 molecularly residual colorectal cancer. RAS inhibition produced a major panc=
reatic-cancer survival advance, while bispecific antibodies improved first-li=
ne outcomes in two gastrointestinal cancers. In immunology, oral JAK inhibiti=
on, FcRn blockade and selective autoantibody degradation are converging on th=
e same diseases.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">The strategic premium is increasingly =
accruing not simply to novel mechanisms, but to mechanisms that demonstrate w=
here, with what combination and in which biologically selected patients they =
can deliver meaningful benefit.</p><h2 style=3D"font-family:Georgia, 'Times N=
